    desc: "Anonymous, legal surrender of newborns 30 days old or younger under Indiana's Safe Haven law. Baby boxes are climate-controlled, installed at staffed fire stations and hospitals \u2014 placing a baby inside triggers a silent alarm and staff retrieve the infant within minutes. No cameras, no face-to-face contact, no prosecution. NOTE: this Woodburn address is the organization's headquarters (not a box itself) \u2014 call the 24/7 crisis hotline 1-866-99BABY1 or use shbb.org to find the nearest physical box. All 18 Fort Wayne fire stations are staffed 24/7 and accept newborns directly under the Safe Haven law (no questions, no arrest). 24/7 hotline: 1-866-99BABY1.",
    tags: ["Anonymous", "24/7 hotline", "No prosecution", "30 days or younger"],
    hoursText: "Hotline 1-866-99BABY1 is 24/7; baby boxes are staffed around the clock.",
